  "description": "<p data-end=\"309\" data-start=\"79\"><strong data-end=\"104\" data-start=\"79\">&bull; Brand introduction:</strong><br data-end=\"107\" data-start=\"104\">NeoNovaDecor is a Toronto-based bathroom brand specializing in modern, seamless design. We offer premium floating bathroom vanities, LED mirrors, smart toilets, and more &mdash; all locally stocked with no wait time. Our showroom address： 250 Shields Ct Unit 7 Markham Toronto.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"550\" data-start=\"311\"><strong data-end=\"337\" data-start=\"311\">&bull; Product description:</strong><br data-end=\"340\" data-start=\"337\">Our core product lines include sintered stone floating vanities, hotel-style cabinets, Bluetooth LED mirrors, and siphonic one-piece toilets. Each item is carefully selected for durability, style, and function.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"587\" data-start=\"552\"><strong data-end=\"585\" data-start=\"552\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"832\" data-start=\"588\">\r\n<li data-end=\"655\" data-start=\"588\">\r\n<p data-end=\"655\" data-start=\"590\">Seamless sintered stone countertops (non-porous, easy to clean)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"705\" data-start=\"656\">\r\n<p data-end=\"705\" data-start=\"658\">In-stock and available for same-week delivery</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"777\" data-start=\"706\">\r\n<p data-end=\"777\" data-start=\"708\">Stylish, modern, and affordable compared to similar designer brands</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"832\" data-start=\"778\">\r\n<p data-end=\"832\" data-start=\"780\">Designed in-house with exclusive finishes and colors</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-end=\"1012\" data-start=\"834\"><strong data-end=\"854\" data-start=\"834\">&bull; Payment terms:</strong><br data-end=\"857\" data-start=\"854\">Commission is paid monthly on the 20th, based on completed customer orders.<br data-end=\"935\" data-start=\"932\">Sales partners earn up to <strong data-end=\"982\" data-start=\"961\">15&ndash;20% commission</strong> depending on the sales model.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"1202\" data-start=\"1014\"><strong data-end=\"1038\" data-start=\"1014\">&bull; Other information:</strong><br data-end=\"1041\" data-start=\"1038\">All marketing materials are provided. Custom affiliate links and dashboard access are available for tracking. Both online and offline referral options supported.</p>",
